@startuml
actor "Developer / User" as U
participant "Lightbridge API (Rust)" as API
database "Lightbridge DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB

U -> API: 1. Create Project "Dev Team"
API -> DB: INSERT Project (plan: free)
DB --> API: Project ID
API --> U: Success

U -> API: 2. Restrict to specific models
API -> DB: UPDATE Policy (allowlist: gpt-4o)
DB --> API: OK
API --> U: Success

U -> API: 3. Mint new API Key
API -> DB: INSERT API Key (linked to Project)
DB --> API: Key ID
API --> U: Returns "sk-abc123..."
@enduml
